    "name": "Ch 17 - Test-case tables for POST /api/users and POST /api/orders",
    "description": "Every row of the two test-case tables in Chapter 17 as a request. Each request name is the case id, what it tries and the expected status code. Run it on fresh data (restart the API or POST /api/reset first): the order cases expect the starting stock.\n\nThe test scripts are explained in Chapter 18.",
